      "ihh:notes": "Sentence from Einstein's letter of 2 August 1939 to President F. D. Roosevelt (the original is in the FDR Library, NARA; NAID 16608874 file unit 'Sachs, Alexander', scan only, no transcription in the catalog). The LoC post says the letter was drafted by Einstein and Leo Szilard; it was signed by Einstein. Context: 'this' refers to setting up a nuclear chain reaction in a large mass of uranium (previous sentence of the letter)."
