      "ihh:notes": "Pull quote in the Einstein life timeline of the IAS page and of the AIP exhibit it is based on; neither page names the document or date it comes from. Attribution to Einstein is by the pages' context (quotes of Einstein in an Einstein exhibit). The two pages share one origin text, so the corroboration is weaker than two independent holders.\n2026-10-09 fix round 1 (task 10b review): removed the EIN-S-0070 (AIP) evidence item. The IAS page EIN-S-0008 reproduces the AIP exhibit text under AIP copyright, so AIP is not an independent holder; this fact now rests on IAS alone (expected single-source). Not searched further."
