      "ihh:notes": "Washington 1921 room, after the owner-approved Nature entry (2026-10-10). Two holders, each covering the whole claim: Nature 107:539 (registered single-record entry, institutional) and the Library of Congress Evening Star page of April 25, 1921 (secondary). Nature does not name Washington, D.C. or the White House and dates the meeting April 25-27 without a year in the same sentence, so the claim keeps the year and the Smithsonian Institution only; the White House reception stays in EIN-F-0090."
