      "ihh:verifiedClaimSha256": "9f88eb494771a9ab0361e5a13d53b70c9c63026ee81f96d3addfcac3235cf7d9",
      "ihh:notes": "Round 7. Reworded from the research candidate R7-F-002 ('first proposed the theory of relativity in 1905', LoC EIN-S-0012 + NobelPrize.org EIN-S-0004): the Nobel quote lacks 'first' and 'proposed', so only the LoC source covered that claim (one holder). This claim uses only words both holders' quotes contain (NPS, Nobel Prize Outreach). Supports showing the first page of 'Zur Elektrodynamik bewegter Körper' (1905)."
