      "ihh:notes": "Round 9 records (research R9-F-001). SINGLE SOURCE (the primary letter). Needs a second holder (e.g. an FDR Library online exhibit page) before it can be spoken; the record itself only needs EIN-F-0110.\n2026-10-30: withdrawn by the extractor (round 9 records merge): the quote was read from the page image of psfa0064.pdf (its OCR is poor), so it is not in the NARA catalog snapshot (G1), and the claim's words are not in the quote (G2); a single primary source in any case. Not spoken (round 9 part B brief: R9-F-001 only if it verifies)."
