      "ihh:notes": "1986 photograph of the study (after his death). 3015 x 2408 px per IIIF manifest. InC-RUU: link only.\nWithdrawn (run einstein-tour-2026-10-15, same run that staged it, on the lead's instruction of 2026-10-15): a place/interior photograph that does not depict the inductee is not a media record; it is listed in data/inductees/einstein/TOUR-RESEARCH.md as a reconstruction-basis candidate (holder, rights, resolution, URL, stop fact) until the owner decides a separate record kind. The adversary verdict is kept for audit.\nRe-opened 2026-10-16 as a basis photo (owner decision 2026-10-16: record kind for photos used only as the basis for rebuilding a room; the 2026-10-15 withdrawal was pending that decision). Linked to stop fact EIN-F-0087 (home study at 112 Mercer Street); taken after Einstein's death, so a reconstruction shows only what the photograph shows. Rights as stated by the holder: link only / reference only. The earlier item verdict is cleared; it is judged again as a basis photo."
